  "code": "union List is\n    NIL;\n    CONS(head: int, tail: List);\nsi\n\nimpl Printer for List is\n    print() -> string =>\n        if let (head, tail): CONS = self then \"{head} {tail.print()}\"\n        else \"nil\"\n        fi;\nsi",
  "fullSource": "use IO.Std.write_line;\n\ntrait Printer is\n    print() -> string;\nsi\n\nunion List is\n    NIL;\n    CONS(head: int, tail: List);\nsi\n\nimpl Printer for List is\n    print() -> string =>\n        if let (head, tail): CONS = self then \"{head} {tail.print()}\"\n        else \"nil\"\n        fi;\nsi\n\nentry() is\n    let xs: Printer = List.CONS(1, List.CONS(2, List.NIL));\n    write_line(xs.print());\nsi\n",
